  m_text: 'You move the player using WASD or arrow keys, aim with your mouse and
    shoot with left mouse button.


    There are only two levels, each one have
    several waves of enemies. You must kill all the enemies to pass to the next level.


    The
    score is based in who made the minimun time to finish the two levels and the
    game stores that score.


    You can press the Escape key anytime to finish
    the current game and go back to the menu.


    Press F11 to toggle fullscreen
    On/Off.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
